      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 32,
      "title": {
        "en": "Highly regarded veterinary care team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners express deep appreciation for the clinicians and technicians, frequently commending Dr. Juarez-Law and Dr. Larson for thorough examinations and compassionate bedside manner. Clients value detailed treatment plans and friendly assistance across routine visits. A few reviewers note inconsistency with specific doctors or delayed email follow-up, but general sentiment remains solidly favorable."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 27,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle and patient animal care"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently praise the clinic's gentle, fear-free philosophy when examining nervous and sensitive pets. Reviewers report that veterinarians use patience, comforting techniques, and tasty treats to keep anxious cats and dogs relaxed throughout physical exams. Owners of senior pets and exotic companions emphasize that their animals receive attentive, delicate treatment."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "waiting",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 14,
      "title": {
        "en": "Punctual appointments and prompt visits"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners appreciate the clinic's efficient appointment scheduling and streamlined lobby coordination. Several clients mention that check-ins are handled promptly upon arrival and examinations begin on schedule, minimizing stress for waiting pets. A minor delay was occasionally reported during peak hours, but overall scheduling is praised for reliability and convenience."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does West Loop Veterinary Care follow fear-free handling protocols?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, reviewers frequently praise the team's gentle techniques, quiet exam rooms, and calming treats designed to keep pets relaxed."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "How are non-traditional pets and exotics handled at the clinic?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Clients report compassionate and skilled care for exotic pets, including small animals and specialized aquatic companions."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are treatment costs explained before procedures begin?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Pet owners note that staff provide estimates, though several reviewers caution that comprehensive diagnostic fees can be high."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
